{"aliases": ["soft lighting", "柔光光质", "柔和照明"], "applicable_path": "lighting.character", "candidate_value": "soft", "conditions": [{"operator": "in", "path": "composition.framing", "values": ["close_up", "medium_shot"]}, {"operator": "in", "path": "environment.mode", "values": ["studio", "indoor"]}], "content": "当构图已被确认为 close_up 或 medium_shot，且环境为 studio 或 indoor 时，人像照明质感优先选择 soft：近距离取景会放大皮肤与服饰的表面细节，柔和光比可压低硬阴影与高光溢出，使主体过渡更可控。该规则只在 lighting.character 仍为用户委托且尚无 active Realization 时提出建议；若用户已明确光质、或场景本身需要硬光，则以用户值为准。soft 只是候选值层面的启发式排序，不保证图片质量提升。", "content_hash": "9060dca2b57809f8d47980b9a10b8b251e04cde4facdb5618c90bc6e27b20825", "keywords": ["人像照明", "柔光", "近景", "光比", "portrait lighting", "soft light", "close-up"], "knowledge_id": "lighting.character.soft_for_tight_framing", "review_status": "draft", "reviewed_at": null, "reviewer": null, "source": {"license": "internal-project-original", "locator": "lighting.character.soft_for_tight_framing", "original_declaration": "本项目原创领域启发式规则，未复制第三方文本；作为待人工审核的 draft 交付，不声称已核实任何模型官方能力。", "repository_path": "knowledge_base/v0.4/lighting.character.jsonl", "source_date": null, "source_revision": "v0.4-draft-1", "source_type": "project_original", "title": "领域规则：近景人像的柔光优先（项目原创）", "url": null}, "target_models": ["any"], "version": "1"}
{"aliases": ["dramatic light", "戏剧化照明"], "applicable_path": "lighting.character", "candidate_value": "dramatic", "conditions": [{"operator": "in", "path": "camera.angle", "values": ["low_angle", "high_angle"]}, {"operator": "equals", "path": "style.primary", "values": ["cinematic"]}], "content": "当相机角度被确认为 low_angle 或 high_angle，且整体风格为 cinematic 时，照明质感优先选择 dramatic：斜角取景本身制造方向感与张力，强光比与明确主光方向可与透视配合，强化轮廓和体积。仅在 lighting.character 为用户委托且无既有实现值时作为候选提出；用户明确的光质需求、PIN 与已有 Realization 均优先于本规则。dramatic 是候选值层面的启发式，不代表必然获得戏剧化效果。", "content_hash": "ffedf23b9b3f54e42502530c3cc4c180483698ebb193cff4205a43059cff68c4", "keywords": ["戏剧光", "强光比", "低角度", "高角度", "电影感", "dramatic lighting", "low angle", "high angle"], "knowledge_id": "lighting.character.dramatic_for_angled_framing", "review_status": "draft", "reviewed_at": null, "reviewer": null, "source": {"license": "internal-project-original", "locator": "lighting.character.dramatic_for_angled_framing", "original_declaration": "本项目原创领域启发式规则，未复制第三方文本；作为待人工审核的 draft 交付，不声称已核实任何模型官方能力。", "repository_path": "knowledge_base/v0.4/lighting.character.jsonl", "source_date": null, "source_revision": "v0.4-draft-1", "source_type": "project_original", "title": "领域规则：斜角电影感的戏剧光优先（项目原创）", "url": null}, "target_models": ["any"], "version": "1"}
{"aliases": ["natural lighting", "自然照明"], "applicable_path": "lighting.character", "candidate_value": "natural", "conditions": [{"operator": "equals", "path": "environment.mode", "values": ["outdoor"]}], "content": "当环境被确认为 outdoor 时，照明质感优先选择 natural：户外场景的自然光方向、色温与阴影形态已由环境设定承载，natural 可避免在 Prompt 中叠加与之冲突的人造布光语义。该建议只在 lighting.character 为用户委托且无 active Realization 时提出；若用户已指定光质或明确要求人造光效果，以用户值为准。natural 不等同于任何具体时段的真实光照，属于候选值层面的保守选择。", "content_hash": "ff132689df02098ce7adf9ac4f1e8025865bb4fa773d4ee4320d0e392cf4f94f", "keywords": ["户外", "自然光", "环境光", "日光", "outdoor", "natural light", "ambient"], "knowledge_id": "lighting.character.natural_for_outdoor", "review_status": "draft", "reviewed_at": null, "reviewer": null, "source": {"license": "internal-project-original", "locator": "lighting.character.natural_for_outdoor", "original_declaration": "本项目原创领域启发式规则，未复制第三方文本；作为待人工审核的 draft 交付，不声称已核实任何模型官方能力。", "repository_path": "knowledge_base/v0.4/lighting.character.jsonl", "source_date": null, "source_revision": "v0.4-draft-1", "source_type": "project_original", "title": "领域规则：户外场景的自然光优先（项目原创）", "url": null}, "target_models": ["any"], "version": "1"}
